11:["$","p",null,{"className":"faq-answer","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Please come with a fresh, completely makeup free face. For hair appointments, your hair must be washed and blown completely dry within 12-15 hours of your appointment. Hair should be \"lived in\", but not dirty. This applies to event makeups, trials, weddings, bridal parties, etc. As far as inspiration photos, please narrow down your choices to no more than 1-3 photos per service (1-3 photos for hair or 1-3 for makeup) with a model that has a similar hair/skin color to yours. We will go over these during your hair/makeup consultation included in your appointment time."}}]
12:["$","div","6",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"feature-title-with-logo","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/_next/static/media/wcf-lips-logo.443457bf.png","alt":"Lips logo","className":"lips-logo-bullet"}],"Can I bring a guest to my hair & makeup trial or in-studio appointment?"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"faq-answer","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Please bring no more than one supportive friend or family member to your hair/makeup trial or appointment. We highly recommend choosing your best hype woman/friend rather than your “too honest” friend so you can enjoy the experience and leave feeling your your best."}}]]}]
13:["$","div","7",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"feature-title-with-logo","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/_next/static/media/wcf-lips-logo.443457bf.png","alt":"Lips logo","className":"lips-logo-bullet"}],"Do I need to book both hair and makeup services, or can I book just one?"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"faq-answer","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Nope! You do not need to book us for both hair and makeup services. We offer flexible booking options, so you can choose just hair or just makeup, or book both as a combined package. When available, our team can also accommodate full hair and makeup services for your bridal or event day."}}]]}]
14:["$","div","8",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"feature-title-with-logo","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/_next/static/media/wcf-lips-logo.443457bf.png","alt":"Lips logo","className":"lips-logo-bullet"}],"Do you have hidden fees in bridal party pricing?"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"faq-answer","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"There are no hidden fees in our pricing. You will see where every dollar is being spent in your outlined contract and what it is for. Our packages show base pricing which includes only the services themselves - added on to your contract will be fees specifically pertaining to travel, parking, early start time fees for your day where applicable, and an automatic included 20% gratuity."}}]]}]
15:["$","div","9",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"feature-title-with-logo","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/_next/static/media/wcf-lips-logo.443457bf.png","alt":"Lips logo","className":"lips-logo-bullet"}],"Do you carry insurance?"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"faq-answer","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Yes, we're happy to share more information upon request."}}]]}]
16:["$","div","10",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"feature-title-with-logo","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/_next/static/media/wcf-lips-logo.443457bf.png","alt":"Lips logo","className":"lips-logo-bullet"}],"Do you offer inclusive hair and makeup services for men, non-binary, and transitioning clients?"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"faq-answer","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Yes - we are always a safe space to help you bring the vision to life you see for yourself long term or just in the moment. We offer anything from slight grooming/polishing beauty services to full glam looks. We will always greet you openly and listen to your wants in a desired look. Every service is tailored to ensure you feel confident, seen, and fully yourself. Pricing may vary depending on client's specific needs and vision."}}]]}]
17:["$","div","11",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"feature-title-with-logo","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/_next/static/media/wcf-lips-logo.443457bf.png","alt":"Lips logo","className":"lips-logo-bullet"}],"How far in advance should I book you for bridal hair and makeup?"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"faq-answer","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"We recommend booking us for your bridal hair and makeup 10–12 months in advance to secure your date, especially for peak wedding seasons in Pittsburgh, Atlanta, and New Orleans. Dates fill quickly, so the earlier you inquire, the better chance you have of reserving your date and our team availability. Last-minute availability may be possible, but is very limited."}}]]}]
